          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eico ifi efyasosa imfumu Yawe ati, “Kanshi nomba nkabwesha Yakobo ukufuma muli bunkole, kabili nkabelela aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli uluse nakabili, epakuti nkakwatile ishina lyandi ilyamushilo ubufuba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo nakabili bakaleikala mu calo cabo ku matwi tondolo, ukwabula nangu umo uwakubasokosha, lyena bakasuka bakalabe kufyo baisebenye abene pakukanaba ne cishinka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo nkababwesha ukufuma ku mishobo, no kubalonganika ukufuma mu fyalo fya balwani babo, lyena nkasokolola ubucindami bwandi ukupitila muli bena pa cinso ca mishobo iyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo na bantu bandi bakashininkisha ukuti kanshi ine nine Yawe, Lesa wabo, pantu nine nabatwele muli bunkole ku mishobo ya benafyalo, elyo kabili nine wine nomba nkabalonganya no kubabwesesha mu calo cabo ukwabula ukushapo nelyo umo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 39:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba ŋanda yakwa Israeli nshakabasuuleko nakabili iyoo, pantu nkapongolwela Umupashi wandi pali bena.” Efyasosa Imfumu Yawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.39.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.39.29"
            ]
          }
